      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "得到的新方程的根的集合和原方程相同."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例1. $x+8.4=6.2$；",
        "$x+8.4-8.4=6.2-8.4$；",
        "$x=6.2-8.4$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2. $-2.7+x=4.3$；",
        "$-2.7+x+2.7=4.3+2.7$；",
        "$x=4.3+2.7$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来比较一下上面两例中的第一个方程和第三个方",
        "程. 在第一个方程中，如果把某一项改变符号后从一边移向",
        "另一边，就可直接从第一个方程得到第三个方程. 由此可以",
        "看出，**方程中的任何一项，都可以把它的符号改变后从方程的**",
        "**一边移到另一边.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在解方程时，有时需要把含有变量的一项从一边移到另",
        "一边. 这时所得方程的根的集合和原方程相同."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 119",
      "box": [
        204,
        1255,
        1115,
        242
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-119"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 119",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在我们按图119列出方程：",
        "$5x=2x+6$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了求出一个面包的重量，我们从两个秤盘中各取下两",
        "个面包. 换句话说，就是从方程的两边各减去$2x$，也就是各",
        "加上$-2x$：",
        "$5x-2x=2x+6-2x$."
      ]
    },
    {
